                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The summit arch. I am the last thing on Victory Road, and I let nobody through unproven - the Fire gym is one descent away and it does not do second chances. I saw you the moment you crested the shelf. Everything you have, right here."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "My Hydreigon has ended more final-badge runs than the leader ever will. The Road is supposed to break you before Scorchspire finishes the job. Show me it will not."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You carry the founder-face, and this high I can finally say it: some of us hoped you were real. Prove it against my strongest and walk under the arch - or turn back and stay a rumor."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Lysandra Skyflare",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
